{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>YourFuelFit 是一款以私隱為先的 iOS 營養追蹤與 AI 飲食教練，適合想控制熱量、蛋白質與飲水，並建立健康習慣的人。它把記錄與計算留在裝置，使用時需自備 OpenAI、Anthropic 或 Gemini 等 AI API Key，以啟用飲食建議、拍照記錄與餐點分析。原價 US $0.99，現<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-7.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>私隱優先智能營養追蹤</h2>\n<p>YourFuelFit 以直觀圓環顯示熱量、蛋白質與飲水進度，支援個人化 AI 飲食教練、每日摘要、晚間回饋及習慣提示。你可記錄蛋白質、碳水、脂肪，以及纖維、糖、鈉和水分，並按減脂、增肌或維持體重自動調整目標。所有記錄儲存在裝置，另提供鎖定畫面與主畫面小工具，方便快速查看及記錄飲水。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-186-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-187-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-188-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-189-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-190-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1284x2778bb-191-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：YourFuelFit</li><li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/yourfuelfit/id6776428352?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:07.351356+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":370,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T22:35:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T01:58:38.064484+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:05.664410+00:00","content_hash":"4d343c98e136f9fa4dc3f2492d1cae83e781105799b1108e340df1e9895f809b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}